# The one place billet's tool versions are pinned. Workflows load this file into
# their environment and scripts source it, so a gate in CI and the same gate run
# by hand use the same tool. Pinned exactly, never `latest`: a linter or a code
# generator that changes under a pull request turns it red for nothing it did,
# and sqlc's diff compares committed code with what one specific sqlc produces.
# One KEY=value a line; scripts/tool_versions_test.go holds every other copy of a
# version (the .golangci.yml comment, the skills) equal to these.
GOLANGCI_VERSION=v2.12.2
GORELEASER_VERSION=v2.17.1
SQLC_VERSION=v1.31.1
TFLINT_VERSION=v0.64.0
TRIVY_VERSION=v0.74.0
